^Kubernetes e2e suite (\[sig-api-machinery\] Namespaces should ensure that all services are removed when a namespace is deleted \[Conformance\] \[Serial\]|\[sig-api-machinery\] AdmissionWebhook \[Privileged:ClusterAdmin\] should be able to deny pod and configmap creation \[Conformance\]|\[sig-api-machinery\] CustomResourcePublishOpenAPI \[Privileged:ClusterAdmin\] works for CRD with validation schema \[Conformance\]|\[sig-api-machinery\] ResourceQuota should manage the lifecycle of a ResourceQuota \[Conformance\]|\[sig-apps\] DisruptionController should create a PodDisruptionBudget \[Conformance\]|\[sig-apps\] StatefulSet Basic StatefulSet functionality \[StatefulSetBasic\] should have a working scale subresource \[Conformance\]|\[sig-auth\] \[FeatureGate:ClusterTrustBundle\] \[FeatureGate:ClusterTrustBundleProjection\] should prevent a pod from starting if: sets optional=false and the configured CTB does not exist \[MinimumKubeletVersion:1\.37\] \[Conformance\]|\[sig-network\] EndpointSlice should create Endpoints and EndpointSlices for Pods matching a Service \[Conformance\]|\[sig-network\] Services should have session affinity work for NodePort service \[LinuxOnly\] \[Conformance\]|\[sig-node\] ImageVolume should succeed with pod and pull policy of Always \[LinuxOnly\] \[MinimumKubeletVersion:1\.35\] \[Conformance\]|\[sig-node\] Pods should support retrieving logs from the container over websockets \[Conformance\] \[NodeConformance\]|\[sig-node\] Variable Expansion should allow substituting values in a container's command \[Conformance\] \[NodeConformance\]|\[sig-storage\] Downward API volume should provide node allocatable \(cpu\) as default cpu limit if the limit is not set \[Conformance\] \[NodeConformance\]|\[sig-storage\] Projected configMap should be consumable from pods in volume with mappings as non-root \[Conformance\] \[NodeConformance\]|\[sig-storage\] Subpath Atomic writer volumes should support subpaths with configmap pod with mountPath of existing file \[Conformance\])$
